1
00:00:00,194 --> 00:00:01,694
and this "marriage" will be over.

2
00:00:01,862 --> 00:00:02,902
(Penny:)Okay.

3
00:00:04,198 --> 00:00:05,698
(Zack:)I don't know if I want to sign it.

4
00:00:05,899 --> 00:00:07,569
(Amy:)Ooh!

5
00:00:09,870 --> 00:00:11,110
(Leonard:)Why won't you sign it?

6
00:00:11,271 --> 00:00:14,551
(Zack:)I just think splitting up
can be rough on kids.

7
00:00:15,909 --> 00:00:17,009
(Penny:)We don't have any kids.

8
00:00:17,177 --> 00:00:18,627
(Zack:)Are you sure?
Because you didn't know

9
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:20,559
(Zack:)we were married
until this morning.

10
00:00:22,783 --> 00:00:24,123
(Penny:)Okay, look, Zack, come on.

11
00:00:24,284 --> 00:00:26,284
(Penny:)You know neither of us
thought this was real.

12
00:00:26,453 --> 00:00:28,563
(Penny:)I mean, we were married
by an Elvis impersonator.

13
00:00:28,756 --> 00:00:30,066
(Zack:)Of course it was an impersonator.

14
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,900
(Zack:)We could never afford
a real Elvis.

15
00:00:36,063 --> 00:00:38,273
(Leonard:)You married him instead of me?

16
00:00:38,432 --> 00:00:40,072
(Leonard:)Good call.

17
00:00:40,234 --> 00:00:41,644
(Leonard:)Sign the papers.

18
00:00:41,802 --> 00:00:42,942
(Penny:)Hang on.
You know what?

19
00:00:43,103 --> 00:00:44,813
(Penny:)You have been a jerk
about this all day.

20
00:00:44,972 --> 00:00:46,312
You always do this!
Whenever I mess up,

21
00:00:46,473 --> 00:00:48,313
(Penny:)you're right there to make me
feel even worse about it.

22
00:00:48,475 --> 00:00:49,415
(Leonard:)That is not true.

23
00:00:49,576 --> 00:00:50,576
(Penny:)We could've waited till Monday,

24
00:00:50,744 --> 00:00:52,124
(Penny:)signed the papers,
this all would have been over.

25
00:00:52,279 --> 00:00:53,729
(Leonard:)You're the one who
invited him here.

26
00:00:53,881 --> 00:00:54,981
(Penny:)There you go again.
Just another mistake

27
00:00:55,048 --> 00:00:56,318
(Penny:)you're throwing in my face.

28
00:00:56,483 --> 00:01:00,023
(Zack:)Not cool, bro.

